---
// src/pages/index.astro
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Marrit Kim van der Staaij | 김여름</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-[#fafafa] text-gray-800 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden">
    
    <header class="relative w-full h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
      <img src="/images/hero-bg.jpg" alt="House and Trees" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 z-10"></div>
      
      <div class="relative z-20 text-center text-white px-6">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-widest mb-4 drop-shadow-lg">
          MARRIT KIM VAN DER STAAIJ
        </h1>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light tracking-widest mb-6 drop-shadow-md">
          김여름
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl font-medium tracking-wide border-t border-white/50 pt-4 inline-block">
          Researcher . Writer . Advocate
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="absolute bottom-10 z-20 animate-bounce">
        <span class="text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Scroll</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 flex flex-col gap-32">
      
      <section class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <img src="/images/marrit-portrait.jpg" alt="Marrit Kim" class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full object-cover aspect-[4/5]" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900 border-b-2 border-gray-200 pb-2 inline-block">About</h2>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Marrit Kim van der Staaij / 김여름 is a Dutch-Korean researcher and writer based in Seoul, South Korea. With her background as a chemical analyst and biomedical researcher, she looks at the world with the questions: "How does this work?" and "How can I contribute to this?"
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Currently, she is writing a book about her journey as a Descendant of a Korean Adoptee (DoKAD), exploring the intergenerational impact of adoption, identity, and belonging.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
            Through writing, advocacy, and research, she aims to contribute to greater recognition of adoptees and their descendants, opening space for accountability, community, and healing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row gap-12 items-center bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-gray-400 uppercase mb-2">Upcoming Book</h2>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 leading-tight">Traces of Freckles</h3>
          <p class="text-xl italic text-gray-600 mb-6">"Back to the country that found my mother abandoned."</p>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
            An exploration of the intergenerational impact of adoption, identity, and belonging through the lens of a Descendant of a Korean Adoptee.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <img src="/images/book-cover.jpg" alt="Traces of Freckles" class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full" />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-gray-900 text-center">Projects & Advocacy</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          
          <a href="https://dokadarchive.wordpress.com/dokadstories/" target="_blank" class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-gray-100 text-center group">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Dokadstories</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">Archiving and sharing the stories of descendants of Korean adoptees.</p>
          </a>

          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/777706757533831/" target="_blank" class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-gray-100 text-center group">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">DoKAD Facebook</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">A dedicated community group for DoKAD members to connect and share.</p>
          </a>

          <a href="https://dokadarchive.wordpress.com/dokadarchive/information/f-4-12-visa-for-dokads/" target="_blank" class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-gray-100 text-center group">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">F-4 Visa Guidelines</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">Helpful resources and guidelines for navigating the F-4 visa process.</p>
          </a>

        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-20">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-gray-900 text-center">Media & Panels</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
          <img src="/images/panel-dokad.png" alt="DoKAD Panel 2024" class="rounded-xl shadow-md w-full hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform" />
          <img src="/images/panel-mosaic.png" alt="Adoption Mosaic Panel Talk" class="rounded-xl shadow-md w-full hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform" />
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900">Featured In</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li><a href="https://n.news.naver.com/article/003/0013233535" target="_blank" class="text-lg text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-600 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-blue-600 transition-colors">Naver News Feature</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://imnews.imbc.com/replay/straight/6710717_28993.html" target="_blank" class="text-lg text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-600 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-blue-600 transition-colors">MBC Straight Interview</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2zMyG2Z9a10&list=PLqQRuDoz8nbp_KA_pSsGyFjyFezHAEPPO&index=8" target="_blank" class="text-lg text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-600 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-blue-600 transition-colors">YouTube Panel Discussion</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kmaeilsinbo.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=358128" target="_blank" class="text-lg text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-600 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-blue-600 transition-colors">Korea Maeil Shinbo Article</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://frieschdagblad.nl/regio/Marrits-moeizame-zoektocht-naar-waar-haar-wortels-liggen-..." target="_blank" class="text-lg text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-600 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-blue-600 transition-colors">Friesch Dagblad (Dutch News)</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>
  </body>
</html>